load ../repair-containment.maude

--- Hazard demonstrated: under the NAIVE armer, a blocked agent's own
--- tracker item arms an incident over exactly the slice it named --
--- filing conjures the power to undo.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-REPAIR-CONTAINMENT :
  armer(naiveArm) trackerItem(agentA, (pa ; pb))
  =>* incident(PS:PSet) RESIDUAL:Cfg .

--- Hazard demonstrated: a raise arms the naive system the same way.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-REPAIR-CONTAINMENT :
  armer(naiveArm) raiseItem(agentA, agentB, pa)
  =>* incident(PS:PSet) RESIDUAL:Cfg .

--- Bite (the laundering fixture): under the CHECKED armer a blocked
--- agent's tracker item NEVER arms -- arming reads a ledger agents
--- cannot write.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-REPAIR-CONTAINMENT :
  armer(checkedArm) trackerItem(agentA, (pa ; pb))
  =>* incident(PS:PSet) RESIDUAL:Cfg .

--- Bite (two ledgers, deliberately unjoined): a raise never arms either.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-REPAIR-CONTAINMENT :
  armer(checkedArm) raiseItem(agentA, agentB, pa)
  =>* incident(PS:PSet) RESIDUAL:Cfg .

--- Coverage: the mediator's stall fact is what arms, carrying its
--- derived slice into the incident.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-REPAIR-CONTAINMENT :
  armer(checkedArm) stallFact(pa ; pb)
  =>* incident(pa ; pb) RESIDUAL:Cfg .

--- Coverage: a request within the derived slice applies, attributed,
--- and the landed repair closes the incident.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-REPAIR-CONTAINMENT :
  armer(checkedArm) stallFact(pa ; pb) repairReq(humanH, pa)
  =>* applied(humanH, pa) RESIDUAL:Cfg .

--- Bite (grant never exceeds the derived slice): a request reaching
--- outside the incident's slice NEVER applies under the checked system.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-REPAIR-CONTAINMENT :
  armer(checkedArm) stallFact(pa ; pb) repairReq(humanH, (pa ; pc))
  =>* applied(humanH, (pa ; pc)) RESIDUAL:Cfg .

--- Coverage (no third outcome): the same out-of-slice request
--- terminates in the refusal + escalation pair, incident intact.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-REPAIR-CONTAINMENT :
  armer(checkedArm) stallFact(pa ; pb) repairReq(humanH, (pa ; pc))
  =>* incident(pa ; pb) refused(humanH) escalated RESIDUAL:Cfg .

--- Bite (demand-gating): with no situation there is no authority -- a
--- repair request against an unarmed workspace never applies anything.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-REPAIR-CONTAINMENT :
  armer(checkedArm) repairReq(humanH, pa)
  =>* applied(A:Actor, PS:PSet) RESIDUAL:Cfg .

--- Hazard demonstrated: the naive system lets the same out-of-slice
--- request land -- the grant exceeded the situation that justified it.
search [1] in WHIPPLESCRIPT-REPAIR-CONTAINMENT :
  armer(naiveArm) stallFact(pa ; pb) repairReq(humanH, (pa ; pc))
  =>* applied(humanH, (pa ; pc)) RESIDUAL:Cfg .
